{"id":"736154be0fae643a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-pr-function.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function (Class)","display":"df-pr-function — Primitive Recursive Function (Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-pr-function","aliases":["92-df-pr-function"],"display":"df-pr-function — Primitive Recursive Function (Class)","depends_on":["[[92-df-zero-function]]","[[92-df-successor-function]]","[[92-df-projection-function]]","[[92-df-composition]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-pr-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-pr-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pr-function — Primitive Recursive Function (Class)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (zero functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (successor function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span> (projection functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span> (typed partial-composition operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> (primitive-recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NF},\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathsf{NF},\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (definition-target function universe and class)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{NF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{NF}\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\bigl(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Z_k\\in C\\bigr)\\land S\\in C\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(P_i^k\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in(C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k})^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{NF}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{C\\subseteq\\mathsf{NF}\\ \\Bigm|\\\n\\bigl(\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Z_k\\in C\\bigr)\\land S\\in C\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(P_i^k\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in(C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k})^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PR：原始递归函数类</li>\n<li>包含各元零函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k\">\\(Z_k\\)</span>、后继<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、投影<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span></li>\n<li>封闭于复合和原始递归运算</li>\n<li>PR函数都是全函数（处处有定义）</li>\n<li>PR函数都是可计算的</li>\n<li>PR <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subsetneq\">\\(\\subsetneq\\)</span> 递归函数（Ackermann函数非PR）</li>\n<li>Gödel编码中的核心操作都是PR的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(Z_k)_{k\\in\\mathbb N}$ (zero functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (successor function, see [[92-df-successor-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headi